+---------+----------------+--------+--------------+--------------+------------------+-------------------+--------+------+---------+-------------+----------------+-----------------+
|  16385  |     16385      |  jobs  |      4       |     none     |       none       |       none        |  none  |      |    0    |      0      |       0        |      none       |
+---------+----------------+--------+--------------+--------------+------------------+-------------------+--------+------+---------+-------------+----------------+-----------------+

admin 'DROP QUEUE q::jobs'
replicate
